window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Secrets, sex, and scandals...Welcome to Storm, Texas, where passion runs hot, desire runs deep, and secrets have the power to destroy...Get ready. The storm is coming. </p> <p>As Sebastian and Marylee plot to cover up Sebastian's sexual escapade, Ginny and Dakota continue to reel from the fallout of Dakota's announcement. But it is the Rush family that's left to pick up the pieces as Payton, Brittany and Jeffry each cope with Sebastian's betrayal in their own way. </p>"; 
